<section class="sec" id="enterprise">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">Enterprise</span>
      <h2>Reliability that never lets you down</h2>
      <p class="lead">What SIPazon brings to large, distributed and security-critical deployments.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ent rv">
      <div><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-ha"/></svg><span class="mono">HA Redundancy</span><h3>High availability</h3><p>A master and hot-standby pair with identical configuration. Intercom connections shift automatically to the redundant server on failure, and roll back when the main server recovers.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-grid"/></svg><span class="mono">Multi-vendor</span><h3>Any SIP endpoint</h3><p>Manage mixed SIP endpoints from different vendor brands, and connect to Cisco, Avaya, Mitel, Alcatel-Lucent, 3CX, Asterisk, FreeSWITCH and Kamailio.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-scale"/></svg><span class="mono">Scalability</span><h3>From one door to an airport</h3><p>The same platform scales from a single door entry intercom to airport and prison systems. MvM handles thousands of monitored objects.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg><span class="mono">Security</span><h3>Encrypted by design</h3><p>SIP TLS signalling, SRTP and ZRTP media encryption in the jPhone app, and tamper-resistant stations for high-security areas.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-rec"/></svg><span class="mono">SIPrec</span><h3>Every conversation kept</h3><p>Record all incoming and outgoing calls by class of service, to local UC-series storage or external NAS.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg><span class="mono">Edge · Fog · Cloud</span><h3>Deploy where it fits</h3><p>Run on UC800, jNode, a virtual machine or SIPazon Cloud, across Edge, Fog and Cloud deployments.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
